  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Dry, Combo, Normal Skin</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A blendable and buildable, dewy, liquid cream blush that melts into cheeks for a wash of color.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Plant-Derived Glycerin: Powerful humectant known to increase skin’s natural moisture level.<br>- Licorice Root Extract: Brightens the overall appearance of skin.<br>- Silica: Provides a smooth, soft feel, and an even application with a blurred effect.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> With its chunky doe-foot applicator, Dew Blush™ can be applied easily and precisely, allowing you to build shades to your desired level of flush. Its lightweight, liquid-cream formula blends seamlessly for a dewy finish that’s never patch</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use the chunky doe-foot to dab one to two dots on each cheek; for deeper color, add more as desired. <br>-Blend on the apples of cheeks, along cheekbones, or higher toward temples for a lifted cheek glow; add one small dot across the bridge of the nose for a sunkissed natural glow. <br>-Build in thin layers, mix shades, or layer under powder blush for more pigment and longer wear.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">ISOCETYL STEAROYL STEARATE, GLYCERIN, TRIBEHENIN, AQUA / WATER / EAU, GLYCERYL STEARATE, SAMBUCUS NIGRA FRUIT EXTRACT, GLYCYRRHIZA GLABRA (LICORICE) ROOT EXTRACT, SILICA, MORUS ALBA LEAF EXTRACT, SYMPHYTUM OFFICINALE LEAF EXTRACT, OENOTHERA BIENNIS (EVENING PRIMROSE) ROOT EXTRACT. [+/- MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR: &nbsp;TITANIUM DIOXIDE (CI 77891), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), RED 6 (CI 15850), RED 22 LAKE (CI 45380), RED 27 LAKE (CI 45410), YELLOW 5 LAKE (CI 19140), YELLOW 6 LAKE (CI 15985)].</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Dry, Combo, Normal Skin</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A blendable and buildable, dewy, liquid cream blush that melts into cheeks for a wash of color.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Plant-Derived Glycerin: Powerful humectant known to increase skin’s natural moisture level.<br>- Licorice Root Extract: Brightens the overall appearance of skin.<br>- Silica: Provides a smooth, soft feel, and an even application with a blurred effect.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> With its chunky doe-foot applicator, Dew Blush™ can be applied easily and precisely, allowing you to build shades to your desired level of flush. Its lightweight, liquid-cream formula blends seamlessly for a dewy finish that’s never patch</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use the chunky doe-foot to dab one to two dots on each cheek; for deeper color, add more as desired. <br>-Blend on the apples of cheeks, along cheekbones, or higher toward temples for a lifted cheek glow; add one small dot across the bridge of the nose for a sunkissed natural glow. <br>-Build in thin layers, mix shades, or layer under powder blush for more pigment and longer wear.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">ISOCETYL STEAROYL STEARATE, GLYCERIN, TRIBEHENIN, AQUA / WATER / EAU, GLYCERYL STEARATE, SAMBUCUS NIGRA FRUIT EXTRACT, GLYCYRRHIZA GLABRA (LICORICE) ROOT EXTRACT, SILICA, MORUS ALBA LEAF EXTRACT, SYMPHYTUM OFFICINALE LEAF EXTRACT, OENOTHERA BIENNIS (EVENING PRIMROSE) ROOT EXTRACT. [+/- MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR: &nbsp;TITANIUM DIOXIDE (CI 77891), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), RED 6 (CI 15850), RED 22 LAKE (CI 45380), RED 27 LAKE (CI 45410), YELLOW 5 LAKE (CI 19140), YELLOW 6 LAKE (CI 15985)].</div></details>",
